  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali: Strengthening the Criminal Justice Chain in the North of Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To develop a multi-layered institutional framework to improve coordination of                actors within the criminal justice chain, through the Consultation and Coordination Groups (CCGs). 2) To                build the capacity of, and improve material conditions for, criminal justice chain/non-state actors. 3)                To increase access to criminal justice institutions by the Malian population through awareness raising                activities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malian criminal justice sector actors and institutions (formal and informal) in the                Gao, Timbuktu, Mopti and Segou regions; and Malian citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed to support the Malian criminal justice sector actors and                institutions (formal and informal) in the Gao, Timbuktu, Mopti and Segou regions to enable them to                provide credible and effective justice for Malian citizens, by addressing locally-identified and                specific contextual needs.</narrative>
  </description>
